00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:48,000
Zootopia 2 is a animation, comedy, adventure film directed by Jared Bush.

3
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:09,000
After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia's history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the
twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De'Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down.

4
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:30,000
To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of
town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.

